derstand the importance of each of the data validation's components.</br></br>\n\nWhen you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.</span></br></br>\n\n\n<strong>My paragraph</strong>\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<strong>It's time to review your paragraph.</strong></br></br>\n<span class=\"italic\">\nWhen you are writing your paragraph, remember to include:</br></br>\n\n\u25cf\tA title</br>\n\u25cf\tKey words that focus on the main idea</br>\n\u25cf\tUse Zero conditional forms and countable or uncountable nouns.</br></br>\n\nProofread your paragraph for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.</br></br>\n\nRead your paragraph aloud to a partner.</br></br>\n\nClick the <strong>Submit</strong> button to save your work.</span>\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 5}]}, {"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}]}]}, "body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "cont