{"_data": [{"content": "quality ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Storage size, amount of data and", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"content": "are part of the data validation.", "type": ""}, "type": "post_question"}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "There's a lot to learn about data validation!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Move the words from the box to correctly complete the sentences.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 10, "type": "SFL"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "enpe7n3le03ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Is your data validation smart?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 12, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n3le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ok, class. To continue with the class, as you can read in your text about data validation, we can understand that smart data validation comprises the delimitation of the database and the definition of the processing environment; therefore, we can say that validation takes place within them. Now, remember that when we talk about this topic, we not only refer to the storage size or amount of data people store but also to the quality of it. There are several aspects of database design that we don&rsquo;t usually take into account when we define our own database. That&rsquo;s why I'm going to explain the most important aspects you need to consider; but be careful because if you don't understand them well, the rest of the process fails.</p>", "id": 0, "image": "enpe7n3le03ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "50000", "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">As a matter of fact, by the end of this short explanation, I want you to write a short summary about the three main components of the data validation processes. So, as I was saying, we have three basic concepts: definition, ownership, and stewardship. The first one, data definition, determines the description of the data you will validate, its limits, and its relationship to other data. This definition varies depending on each organization and even varies among internal subdivisions of each of these organizations. Take into account that if companies don&rsquo;t define the data properly, it obstructs our work from the beginning.<br />On the other hand, data ownership concerns the people who make decisions that affect data, such as defining data (data definition) and considering its validity level.<br />Finally, the third component, data stewardship, concerns all the people who are responsible for data maintenance, from the developers to the users, that is to say, everyone who manipulates the database.</p>", "id": 1, "image": "enpe7n3le03ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "123000", "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Now that you know what components are there in order to validate data, we move to the requirements of the design section. At this stage, we use data-modeling techniques and set metric-gathering functionality for the different operational processes. Here, you have to evaluate the data model; if you don't do it, your database becomes ineffective, possibly because there can be duplicate information. In such a case, the volume of information in your database increases and affects effectiveness, decreasing the rate at which you can evaluate the required information.</p>", "id": 2, "image": "enpe7n3le03ob06re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n3le03ob06re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}], "video_src": "enpe7n3le03ob06re5vsc01"}, "type": "video"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}